  "formula": "The MACOCHA Score is calculated by the addition of the selected points:\n\n| Variable | Points | |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Factors related to patient | | |\n| M [allampati score](nabda:calc.modified-mallampati-classification\\) III or IV | No | 0 |\n| Yes | 5 | |\n| Obstructive sleep a pnea syndrome | No | 0 |\n| Yes | 2 | |\n| Reduced mobility of c ervical spine | No | 0 |\n| Yes | 1 | |\n| Limited mouth o pening, <3 cm | No | 0 |\n| Yes | 1 | |\n| Factors related to pathology | | |\n| C oma | No | 0 |\n| Yes | 1 | |\n| Severe h ypoxemia (<80%) | No | 0 |\n| Yes | 1 | |\n| Factor related to operator | | |\n| Non a nesthesiologist | No | 0 |\n| Yes | 1 | |",
